# Pediatric Growth Candidate Patterns

## Scope note

The rows below are net-new candidate patterns aligned to the requested angles. I did not restate the already-held areas you said are already covered: faltering-growth indicator-base conflict, chart-dependent threshold binding, and the preterm/VLBW corrected-age branch.

